  "@leaderboardWitness": {
    "description": "A veiled witness's display name: their display position, never their name. `eva/redesign.html:942` `witness`, used by `:1070`'s `dispName` and `:1072`'s monogram.\n\n`{position}` is the row's DISPLAY position under the selected metric, and its digits arrive through `digits()` so the Arabic arm reads `شاهد ٢`.",
