  "@leaderboardYou": {
    "description": "The suffix appended to the reader's own row name, rendering as `Mariam Hanna · you`. `eva/redesign.html:942` `you`, appended at `:1115`.\n\nAlso the trailing half of `leaderboardTitle`'s alternative reading? No — see `leaderboardYourRank`'s deletion: this replaces it."
  },
