  "@leaderboardGapLine": {
    "description": "The you-card's gap sentence: the witness one display position above the reader, and how much more of the metric's value they hold. `eva/redesign.html:943` `gapLine`, composed at `:1105-1106`.\n\n`{name}` is already veil-resolved by the caller; `{n}` arrives through `digits()`.",
